<title>UK: Babcock's Rosyth unit in defence contracts.</title>
<headline>Babcock's Rosyth unit in defence contracts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Babcock International Group Plc said on Tuesday its Babcock Rosyth Defence Ltd unit had been awarded UK Ministry of Defence contracts worth over 165 million stg.</p>
</text>
